# Only apps/web and apps/cloud-api (plus docker/) are needed to build the image.
# Everything else stays out of the build context: secrets, local data, build output, desktop.

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-desktop
**/.vite
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

# Secrets and local state (never baked into an image)
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.production.example
!apps/web/.env.desktop
**/.admin-credentials*
**/.keys
apps/cloud-api/.pgdata
apps/cloud-api/releases

# Desktop app (built on Windows, published via the release upload endpoint)
apps/desktop

# Repository and tooling
.git
.github
.claude
.vscode
.idea
docs
*.md
!apps/**/README.md
